CENSUS-V2-W3-A-3-ADD-001\"\n+  ],\n+  \"changed_claim_ids\": [],\n+  \"original_claim_json_objects_preserved_count\": 24,\n+  \"omission_resolutions\": [\n+    {\n+      \"omission_id\": \"BODY-V1-C-OMISSION-001\",\n+      \"omission_sha256\": \"5431d8c76f7e57575a52e044e2330a4d5c87f4a304d94bbb89b0a76a6a07aa96\",\n+      \"original_omission_exact\": \"본문 “제조사 제품을 단순히 다른 용기에 옮겼다는 사실만으로 모든 법적 분류가 동일해지지는 않는다”는 mere repackaging과 compounding 등의 법적 분류가 용기 변경 사실만으로 동일해지지 않는다는 별도 명제를 제시한다. 최종24개 census에는 이 분류 명제가 직접 열거되지 않았다. 008은 compounded 표시·packaging BUD·manufacturer expiry가 다른 정보라는 statement이며, 001의 compounded container label 명제와 함께 읽어도 제조사 제품의 단순 용기 변경이 법적 분류에 미치는 한정을 열거하지 않는다.\",\n+      \"original_omission_assessment\": {\n+        \"id\": \"BODY-V1-C-OMISSION-001\",\n+        \"body_quote\": \"제조사 제품을 단순히 다른 용기에 옮겼다는 사실만으로 모든 법적 분류가 동일해지지는 않는다.\",\n+        \"missing_legal_content\": \"단순 repackaging이라는 사실만으로 compounding 등 법적 분류와 그 label/허가 요건을 동일하게 보지 않는 범위 한정\",\n+        \"why_material\": \"compounded designation와 해당 compounding-pharmacy 전화 의무의 적용 경로를 판단할 때 실제 preparation의 법적 분류가 중요하다. 날짜·표시 정보의 구별만으로 그 분류 조건이 감사 목록에 포함됐다고 보지 않는다.\",\n+        \"closest_existing_claim_ids\": [\n+          \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-001\",\n+          \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-008\"\n+        ],\n+        \"not_covered_by_closest_claims\": true,\n+        \"authorities\": [\n+          {\n+            \"source_type\": \"PUBLIC_OFFICIAL\",\n+            \"official_url\": \"https://malegislature.gov/Laws/GeneralLaws/PartI/TitleXVI/Chapter112/Section39D\",\n+            \"exact_section\": \"M.G.L. c.112 §39D(a): Compounding definition, clauses(1)-(3) and commercial-FDA-approved-drug exclusion\",\n+            \"law_checked_date\": \"2026-11-04\",\n+            \"version_or_effective_date_status\": \"Current official text freshly retrieved/read 2026-11-04; separate clause commencement/amendment effective-date history UNKNOWN. Retrieval/read dates are not effective dates.\",\n+            \"evidence_path\": \"reports/full-corpus-review/independent-notes/body-v1-c-evidence/mgl11239d.html\",\n+            \"evidence_sha256\": \"cfc05f5c2037c4308be48bdd000b81684bde70f664c52d1cc169163fc5762a58\",\n+            \"source_retrieval\": {\n+              \"mode\": \"LIVE\",\n+              \"http_status\": 200,\n+              \"transport\": \"urllib.request.urlopen through inherited HTTPS proxy, default verified TLS; no insecure override\",\n+              \"document_identity_status\": \"OFFICIAL_DOCUMENT_TARGET_PROVISIONS_DIRECTLY_READ\",\n+              \"raw_sha256\": \"cfc05f5c2037c4308be48bdd000b81684bde70f664c52d1cc169163fc5762a58\",\n+              \"retrieved_at_utc\": \"2026-11-04T05:19:45.787829+00:00\",\n+              \"read_at_utc\": \"2026-11-04T05:20:46.304790+00:00\"\n+            }\n+          },\n+          {\n+            \"source_type\": \"PUBLIC_OFFICIAL\",\n+            \"official_url\": \"https://www.mass.gov/doc/2023-01-compliance-packaging-and-reusable-dose-planners-pdf/download\",\n+            \"exact_section\": \"BOP Policy2023-01 II(8),II(9): packaging and compounded pursuant to prescription distinguished\",\n+            \"law_checked_date\": \"2026-11-04\",\n+            \"version_or_effective_date_status\": \"BOP Policy2023-01 adopted2023-04-06; revised2023-11-02 and2025-01-09 printed. Separate commencement UNKNOWN. Current mass.gov PDF directly read, especially II(8),II(9)(d). USP text itself not independently certified.\",\n+            \"evidence_path\": \"reports/full-corpus-review/independent-notes/body-v1-c-evidence/packaging.pdf\",\n+            \"evidence_sha256\": \"b3a205bbd29c3eca5e733d08fcef9d79650b00ea0a9dbc156b4eb474200bd548\",\n+            \"source_retrieval\": {\n+              \"mode\": \"LIVE\",\n+              \"http_status\": 200,\n+              \"transport\": \"urllib.request.urlopen through inherited HTTPS proxy, default verified TLS; no insecure override\",\n+              \"document_identity_status\": \"OFFICIAL_DOCUMENT_TARGET_PROVISIONS_DIRECTLY_READ\",\n+              \"raw_sha256\": \"b3a205bbd29c3eca5e733d08fcef9d79650b00ea0a9dbc156b4eb474200bd548\",\n+              \"retrieved_at_utc\": \"2026-11-04T05:19:45.457492+00:00\",\n+              \"read_at_utc\": \"2026-11-04T05:20:46.304790+00:00\"\n+            }\n+          }\n+        ],\n+        \"finding\": \"본문 “제조사 제품을 단순히 다른 용기에 옮겼다는 사실만으로 모든 법적 분류가 동일해지지는 않는다”는 mere repackaging과 compounding 등의 법적 분류가 용기 변경 사실만으로 동일해지지 않는다는 별도 명제를 제시한다. 최종24개 census에는 이 분류 명제가 직접 열거되지 않았다. 008은 compounded 표시·packaging BUD·manufacturer expiry가 다른 정보라는 statement이며, 001의 compounded container label 명제와 함께 읽어도 제조사 제품의 단순 용기 변경이 법적 분류에 미치는 한정을 열거하지 않는다.\",\n+        \"legal_status\": \"LEGAL_HOLD\",\n+        \"old_review_COMPLETENESS_inherited\": false\n+      },\n+      \"claim_ids\": [\n+        \"NOTE-CENSUS-V2-W3-A-3-ADD-001\"\n+      ],\n+      \"explanation\": \"원24는 원본 그대로 보존하고 누락된 본문 한정 문장 자체를 신규atom1개로 열거했다. 법적 근거는 E가 새로 직접 검증했다. 해소의 충분성은 별도 non-author가 최종25 전문을 다시 검토해야 하며 저자 등록/열거로 독립 누락 해소 credit를 주지 않는다.\",\n+      \"resolution_status\": \"AUTHOR_ENUMERATED_PENDING_FRESH_NONAUTHOR_REASSESSMENT\"\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"inherited_mandatory_legal_blockers\": {\n+    \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-011\": {\n+      \"source_report\": {\n+        \"path\": \"reports/full-corpus-review/independent-notes/body-v1-c-review.json\",\n+        \"raw_sha256\": \"16d98bf341fc6263b26e0b6d4efc9d6b2cfc148b5639aba510248e8a77d863a3\"\n+      },\n+      \"full_original_review_object\": {\n+        \"claim_id\": \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-011\",\n+        \"claim_record_sha256\": \"a9d4fddd4d17eb0516c192a0778a556d0999bf319e99a1791ea4b9bd6afa190f\",\n+        \"statement_ko\": \"두 게시조문 명칭 차이의 적용관계를 명시적 추가 근거 없이 해결했다고 인증하지 않는다.\",\n+        \"claim_read_completely\": true,\n+        \"legal_status\": \"LEGAL_HOLD\",\n+        \"finding\": \"§21의 elderly cross-reference와 현재19A14의 Older adult 표기가 다르다. 현재60세 정의와 large-print 문구는 읽었지만 용어 변경·승계의 구체 근거를 이번 범위에서 완결하지 않았다.\",\n+        \"inherited_legal_blockers\": [\n+          {\n+            \"original_claim_id\": \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-011\",\n+            \"legal_status\": \"LEGAL_HOLD\",\n+            \"finding\": \"§21의 elderly cross-reference와 현재19A14의 Older adult 표기가 다르다. 현재60세 정의와 large-print 문구는 읽었지만 용어 변경·승계의 구체 근거를 이번 범위에서 완결하지 않았다.\",\n+            \"blocker\": \"두 게시조문 용어 변경의 명시적 승계/적용 관계 추가 확인 필요. 이 한계를 전체 요청자 권리 부정으로 해석하지 않는다.\",\n+            \"original_report_sha256\": \"6f48c97fef5e585e38740719c29572ea6d68443b27ab9f4fc67ae90ac3750829\"\n+          }\n+        ],\n+        \"authorities\": [\n+          {\n+            \"source_type\": \"PUBLIC_OFFICIAL\",\n+            \"official_url\": \"https://malegislature.gov/Laws/GeneralLaws/PartI/TitleII/Chapter19A/Section14\",\n+            \"exact_section\": \"M.G.L. c.19A §14: Older adult definition\",\n+            \"law_checked_date\": \"2026-11-04\",\n+            \"version_or_effective_date_status\": \"Current official text freshly retrieved/read 2026-11-04; separate clause commencement/amendment effective-date history UNKNOWN. Retrieval/read dates are not effective dates.\",\n+            \"evidence_path\": \"reports/full-corpus-review/independent-notes/body-v1-c-evidence/mgl19a14.html\",\n+            \"evidence_sha256\": \"ffef27e84d45a50eacca6cbcd50d770f4252b2330087c045cffe62e0757ddfab\",\n+            \"source_retrieval\": {\n+              \"mode\": \"LIVE\",\n+              \"http_status\": 200,\n+              \"transport\": \"urllib.request.urlopen through inherited HTTPS proxy, default verified TLS; no insecure override\",\n+              \"document_identity_status\": \"OFFICIAL_DOCUMENT_TARGET_PROVISIONS_DIRECTLY_READ\",\n+              \"raw_sha256\": \"ffef27e84d45a50eacca6cbcd50d770f4252b2330087c045cffe62e0757ddfab\",\n+              \"retrieved_at_utc\": \"2026-11-04T05:19:45.457038+00:00\",\n+              \"read_at_utc\": \"2026-11-04T05:20:46.304790+00:00\"\n+            }\n+          },\n+          {\n+            \"source_type\": \"PUBLIC_OFFICIAL\",\n+            \"official_url\": \"https://malegislature.gov/Laws/GeneralLaws/PartI/TitleXV/Chapter94C/Section21\",\n+            \"exact_section\": \"M.G.L. c.94C §21 large-print paragraph\",\n+            \"law_checked_date\": \"2026-11-04\",\n+            \"version_or_effective_date_status\": \"Current official text freshly retrieved/read 2026-11-04; separate clause commencement/amendment effective-date history UNKNOWN. Retrieval/read dates are not effective dates. Consolidated first label paragraph omits Acts2025c16 §7 label-name exception; controlling session-law §§7/27 separately read. That change is not a pamphlet-trigger amendment.\",\n+            \"evidence_path\": \"reports/full-corpus-review/independent-notes/body-v1-c-evidence/mgl94c21.html\",\n+            \"evidence_sha256\": \"055e07f501d4e7e6d38ee7669de04ea145c90f0ae5f8c750499778d56fcb0e6e\",\n+            \"source_retrieval\": {\n+              \"mode\": \"LIVE\",\n+              \"http_status\": 200,\n+              \"transport\": \"urllib.request.urlopen through inherited HTTPS proxy, default verified TLS; no insecure override\",\n+              \"document_identity_status\": \"OFFICIAL_DOCUMENT_TARGET_PROVISIONS_DIRECTLY_READ\",\n+              \"raw_sha256\": \"055e07f501d4e7e6d38ee7669de04ea145c90f0ae5f8c750499778d56fcb0e6e\",\n+              \"retrieved_at_utc\": \"2026-11-04T05:19:45.456327+00:00\",\n+              \"read_at_utc\": \"2026-11-04T05:20:46.304790+00:00\"\n+            }\n+          }\n+        ],\n+        \"blocker\": \"두 게시조문 용어 변경의 명시적 승계/적용 관계 추가 확인 필요. 이 한계를 전체 요청자 권리 부정으로 해석하지 않는다.\",\n+        \"fresh_review_observation\": \"이번 LIVE §21elderly와 §19A14Older adult 정의를 다시 읽었다. 해당 statement와 본문 span은 이번 수정에서 바뀌지 않았으므로 원LEGAL_HOLD를 exact inherited blocker로 유지한다. 새 자료 지식만으로 해제하지 않는다.\"\n+      },\n+      \"status\": \"LEGAL_HOLD\",\n+      \"may_clear_in_census_only_correction\": false\n+    }\n+  },\n+  \"all_original_author_negative_records_preserved\": [\n+    {\n+      \"claim_id\": \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-011\",\n+      \"original_review_status\": \"SOURCE_BLOCKED\",\n+      \"claim_record_sha256\": \"a9d4fddd4d17eb0516c192a0778a556d0999bf319e99a1791ea4b9bd6afa190f\",\n+      \"blocker\": \"§21은elderlyperson을§19A14로인용하나현재§14는Olderadult로표기;명칭변경시행이력·통합기관해석별도미확보\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"claim_id\": \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-019\",\n+      \"original_review_status\": \"SOURCE_BLOCKED\",\n+      \"claim_record_sha256\": \"712b798fafb2c360aaffad25c276bb36d0df2ec3257428d77f6bd4e4d81add02\",\n+      \"blocker\": \"원019 LEGAL_HOLD는보존한다. 새literal trigger와수정span을별도non-author가명시재판단하기전까지해제하지않는다. IVnarcotic의전체적용은미확정.\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"claim_id\": \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-024\",\n+      \"original_review_status\": \"SOURCE_BLOCKED\",\n+      \"claim_record_sha256\": \"778463ccb8f949108eeee11dba4ca1eca935355c43464ee66dcf6c7bac6c308b\",\n+      \"blocker\": \"원019 LEGAL_HOLD는보존한다. 새literal trigger와수정span을별도non-author가명시재판단하기전까지해제하지않는다. IVnarcotic의전체적용은미확정.\"\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"historical_status_distinction\": \"C31 independently KEEP019/024 for changed propositions, but their original author JSON SOURCE_BLOCKED fields are immutable and retained. E author correction neither overwrites those fields nor re-adjudicates C31. C011 LEGAL_HOLD and its original inherited blocker remain mandatory.\",\n+  \"native_version_record_created\": false,\n+  \"native_registration_performed\": false,\n+  \"body_activation_performed\": false,\n+  \"queue_ledger_generated_writes\": false,\n+  \"registration_blocker\": {\n+    \"code\": \"BLOCKED_PENDING_N1_ACTIVATION_AND_NATIVE_REGISTRATION\",\n+    \"observed_root_snapshot\": {\n+      \"path\": \"reports/full-corpus-review/body-corrections/w3-a-3-v1/census-v2-author-e/evidence/current-root-binding-snapshot.json\",\n+      \"raw_sha256\": \"e31f6287084822ca4d6060c9d306143089860c61a795ad0ec49abb16e7870ea5\"\n+    },\n+    \"reason\": \"Actual active ledger body16124c… differs from inactive N1e082… and selected active census has23 originalclaims, whereas C31 reviewed inactive N1with24. Census-only native registration requires truthful same-body/current-ledger binding. No future ledger hash/revision is invented.\",\n+    \"publication_blocker_carried\": \"ROOT_SEPARATE_16_FROM_ACTUALLY_PUBLISHED_15_SNAPSHOT\",\n+    \"required_root_steps\": [\n+      \"Preserve this source-only branch and all old report/result/census/011 negative bytes.\",\n+      \"Complete separate16 publication/migration and actually activate N1e082 body through a separately authorized and validated workflow, or implement a separately validated inactive-body reassessment workflow. Do not silently activate it with this author correction.\",\n+      \"Read the actual then-current committed root ledger/inventory/active notes revision; require body SHA e082d19727f6000e00d21a2c78e76405dfd406bf3f1a786242f57a1047c1ab4a and genuine registration-compatible parent/current selection. If parent31 binding and current ledger still disagree, stop and resolve the workflow rather than fabricate previous_ledger_fields.\",\n+      \"Only after genuine binding exists, construct native versionrecord with actual latest parent job canonical digest, exact whole previous_binding, report/result rawSHA, actual notes_census_reassessment.LEDGER_FIELDS, this immutable25census rawSHA, unchanged24mapping/new1/omissionSHA, E author provenance, and inherited011 mandatory block.\",\n+      \"Root alone registers and checkpoints. Actual non-author B/C must read finalbody/all25records and currentprimaries, assess all original omission(s), all preserved propositions and inherited011; R/E knownauthors are excluded. No existing negative is cleared by this source-only handoff.\",\n+      \"Keep current_review_valid/daily/release/currentcoverage false until actual native integration and all independent currentbinding/publication gates pass.\"\n+    ]\n+  },\n+  \"credits\": {\n+    \"author_queue_review_credit\": 0,\n+    \"independent_review_credit\": 0,\n+    \"independent_active_body_release_credit\": 0,\n+    \"canonical_release_credit\": 0,\n+    \"question_audit_credit\": 0,\n+    \"current_coverage_credit\": 0\n+  },\n+  \"canonical_audit\": false,\n+  \"release_eligible\": false\n+}"},{"sha":"32a015c839ba7307dd685d3df373c5b61329d018","filename":"reports/full-corpus-review/body-corrections/w3-a-3-v1/census-v2-author-e/author-review-memo.json","status":"added","additions":133,"deletions":0,"changes":133,"blob_url":"https://github.com/woojunxnam/oddments/blob/c8e8f7b825e576887220867b322779dc5b1c8d67/reports%2Ffull-corpus-review%2Fbody-corrections%2Fw3-a-3-v1%2Fcensus-v2-author-e%2Fauthor-review-memo.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/woojunxnam/oddments/raw/c8e8f7b825e576887220867b322779dc5b1c8d67/reports%2Ffull-corpus-review%2Fbody-corrections%2Fw3-a-3-v1%2Fcensus-v2-author-e%2Fauthor-review-memo.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/woojunxnam/oddments/contents/reports%2Ffull-corpus-review%2Fbody-corrections%2Fw3-a-3-v1%2Fcensus-v2-author-e%2Fauthor-review-memo.json?ref=c8e8f7b825e576887220867b322779dc5b1c8d67","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,133 @@\n+{\n+  \"schema_version\": 1,\n+  \"role\": \"AUTHOR_CENSUS_CORRECTION_NOT_INDEPENDENT\",\n+  \"reviewed_at_utc\": \"2026-11-04T05:49:25.114154+00:00\",\n+  \"actor_provenance\": {\n+    \"actor_id\": \"/root/independent_case_e\",\n+    \"session_id\": \"/root/independent_case_e\"\n+  },\n+  \"author_instance\": \"gpt-independent-session-root-independent_case_e-20261103\",\n+  \"inputs_read\": {\n+    \"inactive_N1_full_body\": {\n+      \"path\": \"revisions/notes/candidates/2026-11-04-w3-a-3-pamphlet-scope-v1.json\",\n+      \"raw_sha256\": \"b2f8c8db6d4c2538edf410939eaf9ce4396973d203fcd70ccb5ed1fc4164ed76\"\n+    },\n+    \"original24_full_census\": {\n+      \"path\": \"reports/full-corpus-review/body-corrections/w3-a-3-v1/census.json\",\n+      \"raw_sha256\": \"3989096b1c43abfd73996e8ce99abe52699cdadd4ada8252ce7514540cf65a04\"\n+    },\n+    \"actual_C31_full_report\": {\n+      \"path\": \"reports/full-corpus-review/independent-notes/body-v1-c-review.json\",\n+      \"raw_sha256\": \"16d98bf341fc6263b26e0b6d4efc9d6b2cfc148b5639aba510248e8a77d863a3\"\n+    }\n+  },\n+  \"materiality_assessment\": \"CONFIRMED_AS_AUTHOR\",\n+  \"classification_atom_ko\": \"제조사 제품을 단순히 다른 용기에 옮겼다는 사실만으로 모든 법적 분류가 동일해지지는 않는다.\",\n+  \"finding_ko\": \"001은 이미 compounded로 분류된 preparation의 container 표시를 전제로 한다. 008은 compounded 표시·packaging BUD·manufacturer expiry라는 정보의 구별이다. 어느 것도 제조사 제품의 단순 용기 변경만으로 모든 법적 분류를 동일하게 단정할 수 없다는 별도 범위 명제를 포함하지 않는다. 원24 전체의 나머지 명제는 large-print/연방환자경고/Department pamphlet 범위이므로 이 분류 한정을 대신하지 않는다. 신규1개는 실질 누락 보완이며 단순 분절 수 증대가 아니다.\",\n+  \"body_census_inventory\": [\n+    {\n+      \"scope\": \"compounded designation/covered phone/employed pharmacist/everyday56h/samehospital inpatient exception\",\n+      \"retained_ids\": [\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-001\",\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-002\",\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-003\",\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-004\",\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-005\",\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-006\",\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-007\"\n+      ]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"scope\": \"designation/BUD/manufacturer expiry information distinction\",\n+      \"retained_ids\": [\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-008\"\n+      ]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"scope\": \"manufacturer product container-change/classification limitation\",\n+      \"new_ids\": [\n+        \"NOTE-CENSUS-V2-W3-A-3-ADD-001\"\n+      ]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"scope\": \"requested large print,elderly/Older adult relation hold,charperinch not fontpoints\",\n+      \"retained_ids\": [\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-009\",\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-010\",\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-011\",\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-012\",\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-013\"\n+      ]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"scope\": \"federalII/III/IV patientdrugtransfer warning vs pharmacist info transfer and MA VI\",\n+      \"retained_ids\": [\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-014\",\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-015\",\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-016\",\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-017\"\n+      ]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"scope\": \"Department pamphlet literaltrigger/nonopioid limitation/exceptions/generic leaflet\",\n+      \"retained_ids\": [\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-018\",\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-019\",\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-020\",\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-021\",\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-022\",\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-023\",\n+        \"NOTE-WAVE8-W3-A-3-024\"\n+      ]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"scope\": \"Week4 crossreference to compounding classification/licensure/USP technicaldetails\",\n+      \"classification\": \"EDITORIAL_CROSSREFERENCE; NOT_ALL_REFERENCED_DETAIL_CERTIFIED\"\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"own_new_primary_review\": [\n+    {\n+      \"source_id\": \"census-v2-e-mgl11239d\",\n+      \"source_type\": \"PUBLIC_OFFICIAL\",\n+      \"official_url\": \"https://malegislature.gov/Laws/GeneralLaws/PartI/TitleXVI/Chapter112/Section39D\",\n+      \"exact_section\": \"M.G.L. c.112 §39D(a), Compounding definition introductory conditions, clauses (1)–(3), and final commercial/FDA-approved-drug exclusion subject to clause (1).\",\n+      \"law_checked_date\": \"2026-11-04\",\n+      \"version_or_effective_date_status\": \"Current consolidated official Section39D text freshly retrieved/read on 2026-11-04. The separate commencement/amendment history of these clauses is UNKNOWN; retrieval/read dates are not legal effective dates.\",\n+      \"evidence_path\": \"reports/full-corpus-review/body-corrections/w3-a-3-v1/census-v2-author-e/evidence/mgl11239d.html\",\n+      \"evidence_sha256\": \"bd50d9891c1ef7932b42e96703169cfa27cecfd4e9f608d45656f721607c61cd\",\n+      \"retrieved_at_utc\": \"2026-11-04T05:41:46.853494+00:00\",\n+      \"read_at_utc\": \"2026-11-04T05:49:25.114154+00:00\",\n+      \"normal_TLS_certificate_verification\": true,\n+      \"authority_scope\": \"Statute, with express definitional scope for §39D and §§36E–42D unless the context clearly requires otherwise; no blanket repackaging exemption is inferred.\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"source_id\": \"census-v2-e-policy2023-01\",\n+      \"source_type\": \"PUBLIC_OFFICIAL\",\n+      \"official_url\": \"https://www.mass.gov/doc/2023-01-compliance-packaging-and-reusable-dose-planners-pdf/download\",\n+      \"exact_section\": \"Massachusetts Board of Registration in Pharmacy Policy2023-01, II introductory paragraph, II(8), II(9)(a)–(e), especially II(9)(d).\",\n+      \"law_checked_date\": \"2026-11-04\",\n+      \"version_or_effective_date_status\": \"Printed adoption2023-04-06; revisions2023-11-02 and2025-01-09. Separate commencement UNKNOWN. Last-Modified and retrieval/read dates are not substituted for operative dates.\",\n+      \"evidence_path\": \"reports/full-corpus-review/body-corrections/w3-a-3-v1/census-v2-author-e/evidence/policy2023-01.pdf\",\n+      \"evidence_sha256\": \"b3a205bbd29c3eca5e733d08fcef9d79650b00ea0a9dbc156b4eb474200bd548\",\n+      \"retrieved_at_utc\": \"2026-11-04T05:41:47.252565+00:00\",\n+      \"read_at_utc\": \"2026-11-04T05:49:25.114154+00:00\",\n+      \"normal_TLS_certificate_verification\": true,\n+      \"authority_scope\": \"Official Board compliance-packaging policy, subordinate to statute. II(8) distinguishes the multiple-commercial-medication oral-liquid-single-dose restriction from compounding pursuant to prescription; II(9) addresses packaging-label/BUD information. This policy does not establish a universal legal classification of every repackaging operation; no private USP text reviewed.\"\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"new_atom_legal_support\": \"AUTHOR_SOURCE_CHECKED_WITH_EXPRESS_SCOPE_LIMITS\",\n+  \"effective_date_limit\": \"Clause-specific commencement UNKNOWN; official current text/version observed. Printed policy revision date not substituted for commencement.\",\n+  \"question_alignment\": {\n+    \"status\": \"NOT_ASSESSED\",\n+    \"related_question_ids\": [],\n+    \"question_audit_credit\": 0\n+  },\n+  \"exposure_and_nonindependence\": \"같은 실제 E instance를 유지한다. 이전 notes/question/초안 감사와 engineering 노출 이력이 있으며 이번은 원C보고서를 직접 읽은 보완 저자 역할이다. 새 identity/fresh 독립 세션으로 포장하지 않는다. R/E는 이 보완본의 이후 independent review 제외 대상이다.\",\n+  \"all_old24_fresh_primary_reverified\": false,\n+  \"body_authored_or_changed_by_E\": false,\n+  \"census_author_enum_not_independent_completion\": true,\n+  \"canonical_audit\": false,\n+  \"canonical_release_credit\": 0,\n+  \"question_audit_credit\": 0,\n+  \"current_coverage_credit\": 0\n+}"},{"sha":"37643d7bdcf13e22323504961e74e4a656c470f8","filename":"reports/full-corpus-review/body-corrections/w3-a-3-v1/census-v2-author-e/census.json","status":"added","additions":2264,"deletions":0,"changes":2264,"blob_url":"https://github.com/woojunxnam/oddments/blob/c8e8f7b825e576887220867b322779dc5b1c8d67/reports%2Ffull-corpus-review%2Fbody-corrections%2Fw3-a-3-v1%2Fcensus-v2-author-e%2Fcensus.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/woojunxnam/oddments/raw/c8e8f7b825e576887220867b322779dc5b1c8d67/reports%2Ffull-corpus-review%2Fbody-corrections%2Fw3-a-3-v1%2Fcensus-v2-author-e%2Fcensus.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/woojunxnam/oddments/contents/reports%2Ffull-corpus-review%2Fbody-corrections%2Fw3-a-3-v1%2Fcensus-v2-author-e%2Fcensus.json?ref=c8e8f7b825e576887220867b322779dc5b1c8d67"},{"sha":"96dee762cbe98c9480142ddca1dafec707f2d67f","filename":"reports/full-corpus-review/body-corrections/w3-a-3-v1/census-v2-author-e/evidence/current-root-binding-snapshot.json","status":"added","additions":171,"deletions":0,"changes":171,"blob_url":"https://github.com/woojunxnam/oddments/blob/c8e8f7b825e576887220867b322779dc5b1c8d67/reports%2Ffull-corpus-review%2Fbody-corrections%2Fw3-a-3-v1%2Fcensus-v2-author-e%2Fevidence%2Fcurrent-root-binding-snapshot.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/woojunxnam/oddments/