%2Ffull-corpus-review%2Fengineering%2Fnative-head-reader-20261104%2Fmpje-native-reader-migration-after.result.json?ref=c8e8f7b825e576887220867b322779dc5b1c8d67"},{"sha":"47b8ad96c7d270f5b7b0e6d5d7515c96f315e679","filename":"reports/full-corpus-review/engineering/notes-consumer-fixture-epoch-20261104/README.md","status":"added","additions":9,"deletions":0,"changes":9,"blob_url":"https://github.com/woojunxnam/oddments/blob/c8e8f7b825e576887220867b322779dc5b1c8d67/reports%2Ffull-corpus-review%2Fengineering%2Fnotes-consumer-fixture-epoch-20261104%2FREADME.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/woojunxnam/oddments/raw/c8e8f7b825e576887220867b322779dc5b1c8d67/reports%2Ffull-corpus-review%2Fengineering%2Fnotes-consumer-fixture-epoch-20261104%2FREADME.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/woojunxnam/oddments/contents/reports%2Ffull-corpus-review%2Fengineering%2Fnotes-consumer-fixture-epoch-20261104%2FREADME.md?ref=c8e8f7b825e576887220867b322779dc5b1c8d67","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@\n+# 원래 C/F 소비 fixture의 후속 ancestry 범위 복원\n+\n+고정 소스 `91a58a12cc5f12a09a0cba3a1a692e8fabfb7687`의 실제 전체 pytest에서 보존된 `test_only_integrated_committed0/repo`를 같은 소스의 `load_notes`와 `load_metadata`로 다시 읽었습니다. 종료 코드 1이며, 원 traceback은 `queue.validate_state → notes_census_reassessment.validate_chain → ValueError: Inactive census successor has no unique append-ordered assignment`입니다.\n+\n+`actual_reports`는 원래 C/F 두 job만 의도적으로 복사한 합성 소비 checkpoint입니다. 후속 census 및 body reassessment 기록은 이미 제외하지만, 새 inactive census successor만 남겨 그 부모 job이 제거된 모순된 fixture를 만들었습니다. 수정은 같은 fixture에서 이 관련 없는 후속 ancestry를 제외하는 한 줄과 설명 주석입니다. 실제 데이터나 native queue에서 기록을 지우지 않습니다. 생산 ancestry 검증도 그대로 유지합니다.\n+\n+기준 후보 부모는 시간 예산 변경을 포함한 `6723e0480d4b5e92224b604e0767402eb5411898`입니다. 36개 assertion AST와 fixture 외 모든 테스트 함수 AST가 동일합니다. 첫 live consumer 테스트와 frontend의 현재 ROOT는 그대로입니다. 생산 코드·runtime·데이터 변경은 없습니다. QA91 HEAD 및 파일은 수정하지 않았습니다.\n+\n+이는 테스트 fixture의 범위 일관성 수정이며 독립 법규 판정·노트 PASS·배포 또는 RELEASED credit을 부여하지 않습니다. 집중 모듈은 실제 종료 코드 0, 12/12 PASS, 848.47초입니다. 원본 로그·JUnit·결과 SHA를 함께 보존합니다."},{"sha":"7aa92df08bbffefe4b12071e354d505665eddef1","filename":"reports/full-corpus-review/engineering/notes-consumer-fixture-epoch-20261104/baseline-existing-failed-fixture.log","status":"added","additions":14,"deletions":0,"changes":14,"blob_url":"https://github.com/woojunxnam/oddments/blob/c8e8f7b825e576887220867b322779dc5b1c8d67/reports%2Ffull-corpus-review%2Fengineering%2Fnotes-consumer-fixture-epoch-20261104%2Fbaseline-existing-failed-fixture.log","raw_url":"https://github.com/woojunxnam/oddments/raw/c8e8f7b825e576887220867b322779dc5b1c8d67/reports%2Ffull-corpus-review%2Fengineering%2Fnotes-consumer-fixture-epoch-20261104%2Fbaseline-existing-failed-fixture.log","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/woojunxnam/oddments/contents/reports%2Ffull-corpus-review%2Fengineering%2Fnotes-consumer-fixture-epoch-20261104%2Fbaseline-existing-failed-fixture.log?ref=c8e8f7b825e576887220867b322779dc5b1c8d67","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@\n+Traceback (most recent call last):\n+  File \"<stdin>\", line 7, in <module>\n+  File \"/workspace/mpje-pr193-qa/scripts/notes_published15_closure.py\", line 95, in wrapped\n+    with head_snapshot(root):return function(root,*args,**kwargs)\n+                                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n+  File \"/workspace/mpje-pr193-qa/scripts/notes_independent_metadata.py\", line 72, in load_metadata\n+    queue.validate_state(state)\n+  File \"/workspace/mpje-pr193-qa/scripts/note_review_queue.py\", line 172, in validate_state\n+    validate_chain(state)\n+  File \"/workspace/mpje-pr193-qa/scripts/notes_census_reassessment.py\", line 65, in validate_chain\n+    queue.require(isinstance(inactive,list)and len(inactive)<=1 and\n+  File \"/workspace/mpje-pr193-qa/scripts/note_review_queue.py\", line 31, in require\n+    raise ValueError(message)\n+ValueError: Inactive census successor has no unique append-ordered assignment"},{"sha":"6e24a0ed7bb6053ed15e0c1ecd5b9f40f94c055c",