. 이 근거는 시간 예산 조정의 동일성 검사이며, 새 GitHub CI의 성공이나 배포 검증을 주장하지 않습니다. 후보 HEAD의 GitHub 전체 CI는 아직 미실행입니다."},{"sha":"8d1e6d56b428faa3e8af567bc0e5fadea84bba56","filename":"reports/full-corpus-review/engineering/time-budget-practice-quality-20261104/annotations.json","status":"added","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changes":1,"blob_url":"https://github.com/woojunxnam/oddments/blob/c8e8f7b825e576887220867b322779dc5b1c8d67/reports%2Ffull-corpus-review%2Fengineering%2Ftime-budget-practice-quality-20261104%2Fannotations.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/woojunxnam/oddments/raw/c8e8f7b825e576887220867b322779dc5b1c8d67/reports%2Ffull-corpus-review%2Fengineering%2Ftime-budget-practice-quality-20261104%2Fannotations.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/woojunxnam/oddments/contents/reports%2Ffull-corpus-review%2Fengineering%2Ftime-budget-practice-quality-20261104%2Fannotations.json?ref=c8e8f7b825e576887220867b322779dc5b1c8d67","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+[{\"path\":\".github\",\"blob_href\":\"https://github.com/woojunxnam/oddments/blob/91a58a12cc5f12a09a0cba3a1a692e8fabfb7687/.github\",\"start_line\":1,\"start_column\":null,\"end_line\":1,\"end_column\":null,\"annotation_level\":\"failure\",\"title\":\"\",\"message\":\"The job has exceeded the maximum execution time of 15m0s\",\"raw_details\":\"\"},{\"path\":\".github\",\"blob_href\":\"https://github.com/woojunxnam/oddments/blob/91a58a12cc5f12a09a0cba3a1a692e8fabfb7687/.github\",\"start_line\":3,\"start_column\":null,\"end_line\":3,\"end_column\":null,\"annotation_level\":\"warning\",\"title\":\"\",\"message\":\"Node.js 20 is deprecated. The following actions target Node.js 20 but are being forced to run on Node.js 24: actions/checkout@v4, actions/setup-node@v4, actions/setup-python@v5, actions/upload-artifact@v4. For more information see: https://github.blog/changelog/2025-09-19-deprecation-of-node-20-on-github-actions-runners/\",\"raw_details\":\"\"},{\"path\":\".github\",\"blob_href\":\"https://github.com/woojunxnam/oddmen